{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16230","id":5004981017,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCxQENc8AAAABKlHzGQ","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16230","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16230.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16230.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16230","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16230/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/16230/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16230/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/statuses/6569043bc424937f7f85d52a185f9f32c86bfb3c","number":16230,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fail startup when persistent queue metadata cannot be read","user":{"login":"Narayan201120","id":159036898,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXq14g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159036898?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120","html_url":"https://github.com/Narayan201120","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### Description\n\nThe persistent queue currently treats a storage error while reading its metadata as an empty queue and continues startup. A later enqueue can overwrite the stored write index and make pending data unavailable. I changed startup to return the read error and close the storage client. I added a regression test that injects the read failure and verifies the stored request is still available after the error clears. The existing corrupted metadata recovery path is unchanged.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nFixes #16232\n\n#### Testing\n\nI added `TestPersistentQueue_MetadataReadErrorFailsStart`. It failed on the old code and passes now; the existing corrupted metadata test still passes. I ran `go test ./...` from `exporter/exporterhelper`; all packages passed.\n\n#### Documentation\n\nThis only changes an internal queue startup error path, so I didn't add user documentation.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:04:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T14:40:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a549599240e9773c0f8d3bf8f4288f45682d2086","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"bogdandrutu","id":1373887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzM4ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1373887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogdandrutu","html_url":"https://github.com/bogdandrutu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogdandrutu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogdandrutu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogdandrutu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogdandrutu/starred{/owner}{/repo}"